  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>⇌</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />Hence <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> so reaction moves in forward reaction<br /><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0076_3e4bd67d751f.jpeg\" /><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><msup><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />So, <math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1.818</mn></math> M"
